+RMSD / DELTAE SA-MAX REVISION v2 (2026-10-24)
+
+The default predict/ pipeline selects the complete-set SA-max parent, matches
+it to an existing framework geometry, and computes RMSD/DeltaE on that geometry.
+No fallback to the largest different linker. SA/HOMO standardization from v1
+is retained. The two maxima remain independent; HOMO is still channel B.
+Use a fresh --work directory. The frozen model has not been retrained or
+validated with this revised RMSD definition. DeltaE is not a model input.
+See RMSD_SA_MAX_V2.txt for rules, tests, usage and limits. The original 3.1
+performance/equivalence claims and the v1 report below retain their old scope.
